injured%2Fsick+people+go%2C+similar+to+an+emergency+room.&example=Serious+cases+of+COVID-19+are+in+the+intensive+care+unit.","play_sound_url":"https://cdn.urbdic.com/audio/tts/4/e/4efa3c-intensive-care-unit.mp3?Expires=1790355361&KeyName=urbdic-1001&Signature=-Gxy6UnCCwyav7l49u__vpFx_9o="},{"author":"Jadoreurmam","current_vote":"","defid":18373015,"definition":"Someone who [eats] a [lot] while bulking to then gain more [muscle]","example":"He is an [intensive] [eater]","permalink":"https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=intensive%20eater&defid=18373015","thumbs_down":0,"thumbs_up":0,"word":"intensive eater","written_on":"2024-11-21T14:22:43.000Z","udimg_url":"https://udimg.com/v1/social/twitter.webp?word=intensive+eater&meaning=Someone+who+eats+a+lot+while+bulking+to+then+gain+more+muscle&example=He+is+an+intensive+eater","play_sound_url":"https://cdn.urbdic.com/audio/tts/5/3/53df7a-intensive-eater.mp3?Expires=1790355361&KeyName=urbdic-1001&Signature=ErzsIb2wlBKXi3W00Xv0VvbVNug="},{"author":"Malicious Matt","current_vote":"","defid":1417400,"definition":"[Nonsense], it means nothing. Its what people say when they [really] mean to [say] \"for all intents and purposes\".","example":"1. For all intents and purposes = [Correct]\r\n\r\n2. To all intents and purposes = Correct\r\n\r\n3. For all intensive purposes = WRONG! You should have paid [attention] in [English class]!","permalink":"https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=For%20all%20intensive%20purposes&defid=1417400","thumbs_down":0,"thumbs_up":0,"word":"For all intensive purposes","written_on":"2005-09-05T00:00:00.000Z","udimg_url":"https://udimg.com/v1/social/twitter.webp?word=For+all+intensive+purposes&meaning=Nonsense%2C+it+means+nothing.+Its+what+people+say+when+they+really+mean+to+say+%22for+all+intents+and+purposes%22.&example=1.+For+all+intents+and+purposes+%3D+Correct%0D%0A%0D%0A2.+To+all+intents+and+purposes+%3D+Correct%0D%0A%0D%0A3.+For+all+intensive+purposes+%3D+WRONG%21+You+should+have+paid+attention+in+English+class%21","play_sound_url":"https://cdn.urbdic.com/audio/tts/2/d/2d1a12-for-all-intensive-purposes.mp3?Expires=1790355361&KeyName=urbdic-1001&Signature=WSzD7vBvqjPyDNVk7pmWzbgSRN0="},{"author":"FiskElection","current_vote":"","defid":4438913,"definition":"Originally used in common [American]/English vernacular as 'all intents and purposes' by just barely unintelligent people trying to sound as if the 'intents and purposes' surrounding them are highly important.\n\nThis phrase has since been changed to 'all intensive purposes' by people who do not listen carefully to the original phrase used in poorly written movies and who have also [never] seen it in print in equally poorly written books.\n\nAlso, the [person] listening to a speaker who says 'all intensive purposes' is likely to overlook it.","example":"Tanar: [Yeah], you're pretty much by best [friend], but for all intensive purposes we'll just call it a tie between you and Kelsey.\n\nAlyssa: [Okay]!","permalink":"https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=All%20Intensive%20Purposes&defid=4438913","thumbs_down":0,"thumbs_up":0,"word":"All Intensive Purposes","written_on":"2009-12-15T00:00:00.000Z","udimg_url":"https://udimg.com/v1/social/twitter.webp?word=All+Intensive+Purposes&meaning=Originally+used+in+common+American%2FEnglish+vernacular+as+%27all+intents+and+purposes%27+by+just+barely+unintelligent+people+trying+to+sound+as+if+the+%27intents+and+purposes%27+surrounding+them+are+highly+important.%0A%0AThis+phrase+has+since+been+changed+to+%27all+intensive+purposes%27+by+people+who+do+not+listen+carefully+to+the+original+phrase+used+in+poorly+written+movies+and+who+have+also+never+seen+it+in+print+in+equally+poorly+written+books.%0A%0AAlso%2C+the+person+listening+to+a+speaker+who+says+%27all+intensive+purposes%27+is+likely+to+overlook+it.&example=Tanar%3A+Yeah%2C+you%27re+pretty+much+by+best+friend%2C+but+for+all+intensive+purposes+we%27ll+just+call+it+a+tie+between+you+and+Kelsey.%0A%0AAlyssa%3A+Okay%21","play_sound_url":"https://cdn.urbdic.com/audio/tts/2/b/2bac0b-all-intensive-purposes.mp3?Expires=1790355361&KeyName=urbdic-1001&Signature=wvkynfcTbTXrGRe-rm-fGwWWq7Q="}]}
